      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Drug eluting stents have made a significant impact on restenosis. However, there are concerns regarding delayed \"catch-up\" of restenosis. In this case report we present two such patients with delayed occurrence of restenosis after drug eluting stent implantation."},
